<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">RRK62.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">2 PETERO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha ya Kabiri eyaahandiikirwe Petero</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Petero</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Pet</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA YA KABIRI EYAAHANDIIKIRWE</para>
  <para style="mt1">PETERO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Nyowe Simooni Petero, omuhuuku kandi entumwa ya Yesu Kristo, naabahandiikira imwe, abaahairwe okwikiriza kw'obuguzi bwingi nk'okwaitu, omu kuhikiirira kwa Ruhanga waitu kandi Omujuni waitu Yesu Kristo; <verse eid="2PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />embabazi n'obusingye byongyerwe omuriimwe omu kumanya Ruhanga na Yesu Mukama waitu.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emitwarize eshemereire Abakristaayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba tureebire ngu amaani g'obwaruhanga bwe gakatuha ebintu byona ebishemereire amagara n'okutiina Ruhanga ahabw'okumanya Ogwo owaatweteire ekitiinisa kye n'oburungi bwe, <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />ebyamureeteire kuturaganisa eby'obuguzi bwingi kandi ebikuru munonga, ngu ahabw'ebyo murugye omu kujunda okw'omu nsi okurikureetwa okwetenga okubi, mubone kukwatanisa na Ruhanga omu buteeka bwe. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />N'ahabw'ekyo mugire obweziriki bwingi; aha kwikiriza kwanyu mwongyereho emicwe emirungi; aha micwe emirungi yaanyu mwongyereho okwetegyereza; <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />aha kwetegyereza mwongyereho okwerinda; aha kwerinda mwongyereho okugumisiriza; aha kugumisiriza mwongyereho okutiina Ruhanga; <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:10">Gal 6:10</ref>. </char></note> aha kutiina Ruhanga mwongyereho okukunda ab'eishe-emwe; kandi aha kukunda abeishemwe mwongyereho okukunda. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Kandi ebyo ku muraabe mubiine, byayongyera kuba bingi munonga, nibibazibira kuba abeeremwa nari abatarikwana byana omu by'okumanya Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:9">1 Yoh 2:9</ref>, <ref loc="1JN 2:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba obuzirweho ebyo aba afiire amaisho, naareeba ebiri haihi, kandi aba ayebirwe ku yaashemeziibweho ebibi bye ebya ira. <verse eid="2PE 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />N'ahabw'ekyo, B'eishe-emwe, mwongyere kwezirika kuhamya okwetwa kwanyu n'okutooranwa kwanyu; ahakuba ku muraatwaze mutyo, timurigwa biro byona; <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:5">Yoh 3:5</ref>. </char></note> kureka muryaheerwa kimwe okutaaha omu bukama obutahwaho bwa Mukama waitu kandi Omujuni waitu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Nikyo nyendera kubaijutsya obutoosha ebigambo ebyo, n'obu muraabe nimubimanya, kandi muhamiire omu mazima agu mwine. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:1">2 Kor 5:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ninteekateeka nti, obu nkiri omu rusiisira oru, nshemereire kubeezirikisa ahabw'okubaijutsya, <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />nimmanya ngu okwihwaho okw'orusiisira rwangye kuri haihi, nka Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo oku yammanyiise. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Kandi niinyija kwezirika ngu, ku ndiheza kufa, mubaase kuguma nimweyijutsya ebyo buri mwanya gwona.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero okuhamya ebi yaareebire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Mumanye ngu titurakuratiire nfumu ezaagunzirwe n'obwengye, obu twabamanyisa obushoboorozi bwa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo n'okwija kwe, kureka tukaba turi baakareebi b'ekitiinisa ky'obukama bwe. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:5">Mat 17:5</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Ruhanga Isheboona akamuha ekitiinisa n'okuhimbisibwa, obu eiraka ryamwizira niriruga omu kitiinisa ekirikukira byona, nirigira riti: Ogu n'Omwana wangye orikukundwa, ou nshemerererwa munonga; <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />kandi eryo iraka tukarihurira niriruga omu iguru, obu twabaire turi hamwe nawe aha rushozi orwo orurikwera. <verse eid="2PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Kandi twine ekigambo ky'obunabi ekirikukira kuhamibwa. Ku murikyetaho, muryaba mukozire gye, ahakuba kiri nk'etabaaza erikwaka omu mwirima, okuhitsya obu buritaagurikana, n'enyonyoozi ey'omu kasheeshe ekaaka omu mitima yaanyu. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Mubanze mumanye eki ngu tihariho kigambo ky'obunabi eky'omu Byahandiikirwe ekirikubaasa kushoboororwa omuntu nk'oku arikweyendera; <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:16">2 Tim 3:16</ref>, <ref loc="2TI 3:17">17</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba tihariho kigambo kya baanabi ekyabaire kireetwa okukunda kw'omuntu, kureka abantu bakaba bagamba ebyaruga ahari Ruhanga, nibakoresibwa Omwoyo Orikwera.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Abeegyesa ab'ebishuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JUD 1:4">Yud 1:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka hakaba haimuka na baanabi ab'ebishuba omu ihanga (rya israeli), nk'oku omuriimwe haribamu abeegyesa ab'ebishuba, abaritaasya omu mubonano enyegyesa erikuhabisa, ekahwerekyereza, nangwa bakeehakana Mukama waabo owaabacungwire, bakeereetaho okucwekyerera kw'ahonaaho. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Kandi baingi baryakuratira emicwe yaabo ey'obushambani; abo baryajumisa omuhanda gw'amazima. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:18">Rom 16:18</ref>. </char></note> Omu kwetenga kwabo baryabaihamu enshaagi, nibababeihabeiha n'ebigambo by'ebishuba; kwonka orubanja oru baacwereirwe ira tiruriikarayo, n'okucwekyerera kwabo tikurihungira. <verse eid="2PE 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:6">Yud 1:6</ref>, <ref loc="JUD 1:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Ruhanga ku araabe atarasaasiire baamaraika obu baashiisha, akabanaga okuzimu, akabata omu biina eby'omwirima okurindirwayo okuhitsya aha kiro ky'orubanja; <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 8:18">Kut 8:18</ref>. </char></note> kandi ku araabe atarasaasiire nsi eya ira, akakiza Noa omurangi w'okuhikiirira n'abandi mushanju, obu yaareeta omwegyemure gw'amaizi aha nsi ey'abatarikumutiina; <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Kut 19:24</ref>. </char></note> kandi ku araabe yaacwereire endembo za Sodoma na Gomora orubanja, akazihindura eiju, akazigira eky'okureeberaho aha barikugyendera omu kutamutiina; <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />akakiza looti ohikiriire, owaabaire ashobeirwe ahabw'emicwe mibi y'abashambani; <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Ezk 9:4</ref>. </char></note> (ahakuba omushaija ogwo ohikiriire akaba atwire nabo, naareeba kandi naahurira ebi baabaire bakora, kwonka agira enaku ebiro byona omu mutima gwe oguhikiriire ahabw'eby'obugomi ebi baabaire nibakora) <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:13">1 Kor 10:13</ref>. </char></note> n'ahabw'ekyo Mukama naamanya kukiza abarikumutiina omu kugyezibwa, kandi n'okugumya abatahikiriire omu kifubiro okuhitsya aha kiro ky'orubanja, <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:7-12">Yud 1:7-12</ref>. </char></note> okukira abo abatwarwa omubiri n'okwetenga kwagwo okurikubashiisha, n'abarikugaya obutegyeki.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="2PE 2:10">Ebibi by'abantu abatatiina Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">N'abantu abatagira ki batiina, ebyegyengye abatatiina kujuma b'ekitiinisa, <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />kunu baamaraika, n'obu baraabe babakiza amaani n'obushoboorozi, tibacwera b'ekitiinisa abo rubanja omu maisho ga Mukama, nibabajuma. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Kwonka abo bashusha nk'enyamaishwa ezitaine bwengye, ezaahangiirwe kutegwa n'okwitwa, kandi basheka ebi batarikumanya; aha muheru okuhwerekyerera kwabo nabo kuryabahwerekyereza, <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />bakorwe kubi, nibaihurwa ebihembo by'okukora kubi kwabo. Beesiimira ebinoomo nyomushana; n'abantu b'amabara mabi n'obumogo, bazaana kubi omu magyenyi gaabo, nibariira hamwe naimwe; <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />baine amaisho agaijwire obushambani, kandi agataruha kushiisha; niboosya ab'emitima etahamire, baine omutima ogumanyiire okwetenga okubi; n'abaana bakyeenirwe; <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:7">Kub 22:7</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 22:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:14">Kush 2:14</ref>. </char></note> abaateishukire omuhanda oguhikire, bakahaba, bakatoora omuhanda gwa Balamu mutabani wa Beori, owaakunzire ebihembo by'okutahikiirira; <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />kwonka akahanwa ahabw'okushiisha kwe, obu endogoya etagamba yaagamba nk'omuntu, ekazibira eiraro rya nabi ogwo.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JUD 1:12-16">Yud 1:12-16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abo ni nk'amaziba agatarimu maizi, kandi ebicu ebitwarwa omuyaga; barindiirwe okunagwa omu mwirima ndindindi. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Bagamba ebigambo ebikuru eby'okwetunguura ebitaine mugasho; boosya abantu ababa bahungire abatuura omu buhabe, nibababeihabeihesa okwetenga okubi okw'omubiri. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:34">Yoh 8:34</ref>. </char></note> Babaraganisa obusingye, haza bo bari abahuuku b'okujunda; ahakuba ekisingura omuntu, nikyo aba omuhuuku waakyo. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:45">Mat 12:45</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba abaaherize kukira ebihagaro eby'ensi ahabw'okumanya Mukama n'Omujuni waitu Yesu Kristo, ku baagaruka kubyetaasyamu, byabasingura, ebya bwanyima byabo biba bibi okukira eby'okubanza. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:48">Luk 12:48</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu ekyakubaire gye aharibo, kuri bataramanyire muhanda gw'okuhikiirira, okukira obu baherize kugumanya, bakateishuka, bakareka ekiragiro ekirikwera eki baahairwe. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 26:11">Enf 26:11</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo kibahikireho nk'enfumu y'amazima erikugira eti: Embwa neegarukira ebitanaki byayo, n'empunu eyoogiibwe egaruka kwekuringa omu shaabo.<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okugaruka kwa Mukama waitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Abarikukundwa, egi n'ebaruha ya kabiri ei naabahandiikira; omu baruha ezo zombi eki naagyendereire n'okusisiimura emitima yaanyu etarimu buryarya nimbaijutsya; <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />ngu mwijukye ebigambo ebyagambirwe ira baanabi abarikwera, n'ekiragiro kya Mukama kandi Omujuni waitu eki mwagambiirwe entumwa ezaabatumirweho. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:1">1 Tim 4:1</ref>. </char></note> Mubanze mumanye eki ngu, omu biro by'aha mperu haryaija abagaaniizi abarikugaaniiza, nibakuratira okwetenga kwabo okubi, <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:48">Mat 24:48</ref>. </char></note> nibagira bati: Ku yaaraganiise kwija! Mbwenu arahi? Ahakuba okwiha obu baatatenkuriitwe baagwejegyera, byona bituura nk'oku byabaire biri aha kutandika kw'okuhangwa kw'ensi. <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:2">Kut 1:2</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 1:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nibabyeyebesa nkana, nibamanya ngu hakaba hariho eiguru okuruga ira, n'ensi eyaahangirwe ekigambo kya Ruhanga okuruga omu maizi, kandi ekaguma eri ahagati yaago; <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:21">Kut 7:21</ref>. </char></note> kandi ahabw'ekigambo kya Ruhanga ensi eyaabaire eriho ekagaruka yaashwekwa amaizi g'omwegyemure, yaamirwa; <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />kwonka eiguru n'ensi ebiriho hati, ahabw'ekigambo ekyo, bibiikiirwe omuriro, nibirindwa okuhitsya aha kiro ky'orubanja eki abantu abatatiina Ruhanga baricwekyererezibwaho.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 90:4">Zab 90:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka, B'eishe-emwe, mutaryebwa ekigambo eki, ngu ekiro kimwe ahari Mukama ni nk'emyaka rukumi, kandi n'emyaka rukumi ni nk'ekiro kimwe. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:4">1 Tim 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Mukama tatuuzayo ki yaaraganiise, nk'abamwe oku barikuteekateeka, kureka agumisiriza ahabwanyu, atarikwenda muntu weena kuhwerekyerera, kureka naayenda ngu boona bahikye aha kweteisa. <verse eid="2PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:2">1 Tes 5:2</ref>, <ref loc="1TH 5:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ekiro kya Mukama kiryaija nk'omushuma; obwo eiguru riryarugaho n'okuhinda kuhango, n'ebintu by'obuhangwa biryayagibwa omuriro, kandi ensi n'ebigirimu biryayokibwa.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okweteekateekyera eby'aha mperu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Ebyo byona ku biraabe biri eby'okuyaga bityo, mureebe oku mushemereire kuba abarikwera kandi abarikutiina Ruhanga omu mitwarize yaanyu, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Isa 34:4</ref>. </char></note> nimutegyereza ekiro kya Mukama, kandi nimukora eby'okukirahutsya; ahabw'ekyo kiro eiguru riryayokibwa rihweho, kandi eby'obuhangwa biryayagibwa omuriro mwingi. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:1">Kush 21:1</ref>, <ref loc="REV 21:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka itwe nitutegyereza eiguru eritsya n'ensi ensya ebituurwamu okuhikiirira, nk'oku yaaraganiise.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />N'ahabw'ekyo, abarikukundwa, nk'oku mutegyereize ebyo, mwezirikye abashangye mwine obusingye, mutaine ibara ribi n'obu kaakuba akamogo omu maisho ge. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:4">Rom 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu okugumisiriza kwa Mukama waitu okwo nikwo kujunwa; nka mugyenzi waitu orikukundwa Paulo oku yaabahandiikiire nk'obwengye obu yaahairwe oku buri, <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />naagamba atyo omu baruha ze zoona. Omuri ezo harimu ebigambo bimwe ebigumire kwetegyerezibwa, ebi abatarikwetegyereza n'abatahamire bakiikamya, nk'oku bagira ebyahandiikirwe ebindi, bakeereetaho okuhwerekyerera. <verse eid="2PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />N'ahabw'ekyo naimwe, abarikukundwa, nk'oku mushangirwe nimumanya ebyo, mwerinde mutahabisibwa obuhabe bw'abantu babi, mukaruga omu kuhama kwanyu. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Kureka mukurire omu mbabazi za Mukama waitu kandi Omujuni Yesu Kristo, n'omu kumumanya. Aheebwe ekitiinisa hati n'ebiro byona. Amiina.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>